sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as EdgeMed Core
    participant SQLite as SQLite Sync Queue
    participant Shard as Local Qdrant Edge Shard
    participant Server as Central Qdrant Server

    Note over App,Server: UPLINK PHASE: Points Replicated to Server
    App->>SQLite: Fetch batch of PENDING records (Limit: 10)
    SQLite-->>App: Return PointStruct items
    App->>Server: POST /collections/{name}/points (Batch Upsert via mTLS)
    alt Upload Succeeded (HTTP 200)
        Server-->>App: Acknowledge Points Written
        App->>SQLite: UPDATE sync_queue SET status = 'COMMITTED'
    else Network Lost or Timeout
        App->>SQLite: Increment retry_count, status = 'PENDING'
        Note over App: Apply Exponential Backoff with Jitter
    end

    Note over App,Server: DOWNLINK PHASE: Differential Snapshot Recovery
    App->>Shard: Extract local snapshot manifest JSON
    Shard-->>App: Local Manifest (Segment Hashes)
    App->>Server: POST /collections/{name}/shards/{id}/snapshot/partial/create
    Server-->>App: Stream partial.snapshot (Changed segments only)
    App->>Shard: EdgeShard.recover_partial_snapshot(...)
    Shard-->>App: Manifest Updated & Snapshot Mounted
